  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\natural.succ(n_)]\nDefines: succ(n_) is (? is \\natural) -> (? is \\natural)\nDocumented:\n. called: \"successor of $n?$\"\n. written: \"n?+\\!\\!+\"\n. description: \"The successor of a natural number $n$ is the natural number\n                immediately after it, informally $n + 1$. Every natural number\n                other than zero is the successor of exactly one natural number.\"\nId: \"ffa1fbbf-8be1-4fd7-b759-5f39b30840e7\"",
